a breaker on repetition cannot tell a harmless polling loop from a destructive one, so the fifth lookup is refused even though lookups are harmless, and the threshold and the set of tools it applies to are policy choices"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Reading the Verified Output","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲಿತ Output ಓದುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Switch and Breaker","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: Switch ಮತ್ತು Breaker","bodyEn":"Section 1: lookup_order was permitted, and after the operator set agent_enabled to false delete_order was refused with External kill switch disabled. Section 2: five identical delete_record calls gave counts 1 to 5 with the first four allowed, the fifth refused with the state OPEN, and a sixth refused as Circuit already open.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 1: lookup_order ಅನುಮತಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಆಪರೇಟರ್ agent_enabled ಅನ್ನು false ಮಾಡಿದ ನಂತರ delete_order External kill switch disabled ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 2: ಐದು ಒಂದೇ delete_record ಕರೆಗಳು 1 ರಿಂದ 5 ಎಣಿಕೆ ನೀಡಿದವು, ಮೊದಲ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಅನುಮತಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟು ಐದನೆಯದು OPEN ಸ್ಥಿತಿಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಆರನೆಯದು Circuit already open ಎಂದು ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Normalisation, Canary and a Harmless Loop","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯೀಕರಣ, Canary ಮತ್ತು ಹಾನಿರಹಿತ ಲೂಪ್","bodyEn":"Section 3: the same arguments in different key order counted 1, 2, 3, while calls on records 42, 43 and 44 counted 1, 1, 1. Section 4: the ordinary read passed, the canary read was refused with a HIGH severity alert and one alert was recorded. Section 5: five identical lookups gave True, True, True, True, False.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 3: ಬೇರೆ key ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಅದೇ ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್‌ಗಳು 1, 2, 3 ಎಂದು ಎಣಿಕೆಯಾದವು, ಮತ್ತು ದಾಖಲೆ 42, 43 ಮತ್ತು 44 ಮೇಲಿನ ಕರೆಗಳು 1, 1, 1. ವಿಭಾಗ 4: ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ಓದು ಹಾದುಹೋಯಿತು, canary ಓದು HIGH ತೀವ್ರತೆಯ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು ಮತ್ತು ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ದಾಖಲಾಯಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 5: ಐದು ಒಂದೇ lookup ಗಳು True, True, True, True, False ನೀಡಿದವು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Why AI Uses This","headingKn":"AI ಇದನ್ನು ಏಕೆ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ","bodyEn":"Each detector covers a gap the others leave: the switch stops everything, the breaker stops a pattern and the canary shows access that no task should need, and none of them replaces permissions.","bodyKn":"ಪ್ರತಿ ಪತ್ತೆಕಾರಕ ಇತರವು ಬಿಡುವ ಅಂತರ ಮುಚ್ಚುತ್ತದೆ: switch ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, breaker ಮಾದರಿ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು canary ಯಾವ ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ಕೂ ಬೇಡದ ಪ್ರವೇಶ ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು ಯಾವುದೂ ಅನುಮತಿಗಳನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Common Misconception","headingKn":"ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ","bodyEn":"Misconception: "a breaker only fires on harmful loops." Five harmless lookups also opened it, so its scope and threshold are policy choices.","bodyKn":"ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ: "breaker ಹಾನಿಕಾರಕ ಲೂಪ್‌ಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ಉರಿಯುತ್ತದೆ." ಐದು ಹಾನಿರಹಿತ lookup ಗಳೂ ಅದನ್ನು ತೆರೆದವು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅದರ ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಮಿತಿ ನೀತಿ ಆಯ್ಕೆಗಳು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Terms","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಪದಗಳು","bodyEn":"Kill switch: an externally owned stop. Circuit breaker: a block on an abnormal pattern. Canary: a decoy whose access raises an alert. Normalisation: a standard form so equal calls compare equal.","bodyKn":"Kill switch: ಹೊರಗಿನ ಒಡೆತನದ ನಿಲುಗಡೆ. Circuit breaker: ಅಸಹಜ ಮಾದರಿಯ ತಡೆ. Canary: ಪ್ರವೇಶ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಎತ್ತುವ decoy. Normalisation: ಸಮಾನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಸಮನಾಗಿ ಹೋಲಿಸಲು ಪ್ರಮಾಣಿತ ರೂಪ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Takeaways","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಅಂಶಗಳು","bodyEn":"1) The switch was read on every action. 2) The breaker refused the fifth identical call before it ran. 3) Key order did not change the signature. 4) The canary read raised one alert. 5) Five lookups also tripped the breaker.","bodyKn":"1) switch ಪ್ರತಿ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಓದಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು. 2) breaker ಐದನೇ ಒಂದೇ ಕರೆಯನ್ನು ಅದು ಓಡುವ ಮೊದಲು ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಿತು. 3) key ಕ್ರಮ ಸಹಿ ಬದಲಿಸಲಿಲ್ಲ. 4) canary ಓದು ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಎತ್ತಿತು. 5) ಐದು lookup ಗಳೂ breaker ಅನ್ನು ಉರಿಸಿದವು."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"On which identical call did the breaker open?","qKn":"ಯಾವ ಒಂದೇ ಕರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ breaker ತೆರೆಯಿತು?","opts":["The fifth","The first","The third","The sixth"],"optsKn":["ಐದನೆಯದು","ಮೊದಲನೆಯದು","ಮೂರನೆಯದು","ಆರನೆಯದು"],"correct":0},{"q":"What counts did calls on records 42, 43 and 44 produce?","qKn":"ದಾಖಲೆ 42, 43 ಮತ್ತು 44 ಮೇಲಿನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಯಾವ ಎಣಿಕೆ ನೀಡಿದವು?","opts":["1, 1, 1","1, 2, 3","3, 3, 3","0, 0, 0"],"optsKn":["1, 1, 1","1, 2, 3","3, 3, 3","0, 0, 0"],"correct":0},{"q":"What did sorting the argument keys achieve?","qKn":"ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್ keys ವಿಂಗಡಿಸುವುದು ಏನು ಸಾಧಿಸಿತು?","opts":["Equal calls in a different key order counted as one repeated action","It disabled the breaker","It hid the canary","It reset the switch"],"optsKn":["ಬೇರೆ key ಕ್ರಮದ ಸಮಾನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಒಂದು ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿತ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಾಗಿ ಎಣಿಕೆಯಾದವು","ಅದು breaker ನಿಷ್ಕ್ರಿಯಗೊಳಿಸಿತು","ಅದು canary ಮರೆಮಾಡಿತು","ಅದು switch ಮರುಹೊಂದಿಸಿತು"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many alerts did the canary read record?","qKn":"canary ಓದು ಎಷ್ಟು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ದಾಖಲಿಸಿತು?","opts":["1","0","2","5"],"optsKn":["1","0","2","5"],"correct":0},{"q":"Why is the lab kill switch not a real security boundary?","qKn":"ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ kill switch ನಿಜ ಭದ್ರತಾ ಗಡಿ ಏಕೆ ಅಲ್ಲ?","opts":["Its state is a dictionary in the same process","It cannot be read","It never changes","It uses a database"],"optsKn":["ಅದರ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಅದೇ ಪ್ರಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಲ್ಲಿನ ನಿಘಂಟು","ಅದನ್ನು ಓದಲಾಗದು","ಅದು ಎಂದಿಗೂ ಬದಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ","ಅದು ಡೇಟಾಬೇಸ್ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ"],"correct":0}]}}]

builderEn:
[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Kill Switches, Circuit Breakers, Canary Tokens (Part 2 of 3)","textKn":"Kill Switches, Circuit Breakers, Canary Tokens (ಭಾಗ 2 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 2 of 3: an integrated safety gateway that checks the kill switch, a hard policy, the canary and the breaker in order, a ten-step trajectory, the eager-evaluation bug the lesson warned about, half-open recovery and seven unit tests that are run. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind kill switches, circuit breakers and canary tokens (an externally owned stop, a repetition breaker, canary monitoring, an ordered safety gateway, fail-closed control, EWMA and CUSUM, a shared-counter race, a hard policy and incident recovery), not the real software, and the control store, the policy and the incident token live in the same process, the executor only records requests, the rates are invented and nothing is sent, deleted or run for real, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The original code/main.py was not supplied, so the labs are our own implementation. The lesson Redis, signed-configuration, eBPF and Cilium material, including its latency remarks, is conceptual and was not run here because it needs third-party services; the labs cover the standard-library parts. The lesson Part 2 warned that its first gateway version had a bug, and the lab reproduces that bug and its fix. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 2ನೆಯದು: kill switch, ಕಠಿಣ ನೀತಿ, canary ಮತ್ತು breaker ಅನ್ನು ಕ್ರಮವಾಗಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸುವ ಸಂಯೋಜಿತ ಸುರಕ್ಷತಾ gateway, ಹತ್ತು-ಹಂತದ trajectory, lesson ಎಚ್ಚರಿಸಿದ eager-ಮೌಲ್ಯಮಾಪನ ದೋಷ, half-open ಚೇತರಿಕೆ ಮತ್ತು ಓಡಿಸಿದ ಏಳು unit ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗಳು. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು kill switches, circuit breakers ಮತ್ತು canary tokens (ಹೊರಗಿನ ಒಡೆತನದ ನಿಲುಗಡೆ, ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆ breaker, canary ಮೇಲ್ವಿಚಾರಣೆ, ಕ್ರಮಬದ್ಧ ಸುರಕ್ಷತಾ gateway, fail-closed ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ, EWMA ಮತ್ತು CUSUM, ಹಂಚಿದ ಕೌಂಟರ್ ಓಟ, ಕಠಿಣ ನೀತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಘಟನೆ ಚೇತರಿಕೆ) ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, ನಿಜವಾದ ಸಾಫ್ಟ್‌ವೇರ್ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ ಸಂಗ್ರಹ, ನೀತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಘಟನೆ token ಅದೇ ಪ್ರಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಲ್ಲಿವೆ, executor ವಿನಂತಿಗಳನ್ನು ದಾಖಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಮಾತ್ರ, ದರಗಳು ಕಲ್ಪಿತ ಮತ್ತು ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಏನೂ ಕಳುಹಿಸಲ್ಪಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ, ಅಳಿಸಲ್ಪಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ ಅಥವಾ ಓಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಮೂಲ code/main.py ಒದಗಿಸಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ಗಳು ನಮ್ಮದೇ ಅನುಷ್ಠಾನ. lesson ನ Redis, ಸಹಿ ಮಾಡಿದ ಸಂರಚನೆ, eBPF ಮತ್ತು Cilium ವಿಷಯ, ಅದರ ವಿಳಂಬ ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿಗಳು ಸೇರಿ, ಪರಿಕಲ್ಪನಾತ್ಮಕ ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಓಡಿಸಲಾಗಿಲ್ಲ ಏಕೆಂದರೆ ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಮೂರನೇ ಪಕ್ಷದ ಸೇವೆಗಳು ಬೇಕು; ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ಗಳು standard-library ಭಾಗಗಳನ್ನು ಒಳಗೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತವೆ. lesson ನ ಭಾಗ 2 ಅದರ ಮೊದಲ gateway ಆವೃತ್ತಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ದೋಷವಿತ್ತು ಎಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಸಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಆ ದೋಷ ಮತ್ತು ಅದರ ಪರಿಹಾರವನ್ನು ಪುನರುತ್ಪಾದಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Order of Checks Is Part of the Design","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳ ಕ್ರಮ ವಿನ್ಯಾಸದ ಭಾಗ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"One Gateway, Seven Tests","headingKn":"ಒಂದು Gateway, ಏಳು ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗಳು","bodyEn":"This part joins the three detectors and a hard policy behind one gateway that the agent must go through. The agent submits a structured request, the gateway evaluates the kill switch, the hard policy, the canary monitor and the breaker in that order and stops at the first denial, and only a fully approved request reaches an executor that records it. The lesson warned that building the list of decisions eagerly evaluates every detector, and the lab runs both versions and compares what each leaves behind.","bodyKn":"ಈ ಭಾಗ ಮೂರು ಪತ್ತೆಕಾರಕಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಕಠಿಣ ನೀತಿಯನ್ನು agent ಹಾದುಹೋಗಲೇಬೇಕಾದ ಒಂದು gateway ಹಿಂದೆ ಸೇರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. agent ರಚನಾತ್ಮಕ ವಿನಂತಿ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, gateway kill switch, ಕಠಿಣ ನೀತಿ, canary ಮಾನಿಟರ್ ಮತ್ತು breaker ಅನ್ನು ಆ ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಮೌಲ್ಯಮಾಪನ ಮಾಡಿ ಮೊದಲ ನಿರಾಕರಣೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಲ್ಲುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣ ಅನುಮೋದಿತ ವಿನಂತಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ಅದನ್ನು ದಾಖಲಿಸುವ executor ತಲುಪುತ್ತದೆ. ನಿರ್ಧಾರಗಳ ಪಟ್ಟಿಯನ್ನು eager ಆಗಿ ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವುದು ಪ್ರತಿ ಪತ್ತೆಕಾರಕವನ್ನು ಮೌಲ್ಯಮಾಪನ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ ಎಂದು lesson ಎಚ್ಚರಿಸಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಎರಡೂ ಆವೃತ್ತಿಗಳನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸಿ ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದು ಏನು ಬಿಡುತ್ತದೆ ಹೋಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"The Safety Gateway","headingKn":"ಸುರಕ್ಷತಾ Gateway","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">a denied request must change no detector state</text><rect x="10" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="50" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">request</text><text x="50" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">from the agent</text><rect x="110" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"/><text x="150" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">gateway</text><text x="150" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">ordered checks</text><rect x="210" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#a78bfa"/><text x="250" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">first denial</text><text x="250" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">stops the rest</text><rect x="80" y="110" width="140" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="150" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">executor</text><text x="150" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">only if all pass</text><path d="M150,64 V110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">a denied request must change no detector state</text></svg>","captionEn":"Checks run in order and the first denial stops the chain.","captionKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳು ಕ್ರಮವಾಗಿ ಓಡುತ್ತವೆ ಮತ್ತು ಮೊದಲ ನಿರಾಕರಣೆ ಸರಪಳಿ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"The ten-step trajectory","headingKn":"ಹತ್ತು-ಹಂತದ trajectory","headers":["Step","Expected result"],"rows":[["1 and 2","lookup_order and update_ticket are allowed"],["3 to 6","the first four delete_record calls are allowed"],["7","the fifth delete_record call is blocked by the breaker"],["8","read of the decoy file is blocked with an alert"],["9 and 10","operator disables the agent, send_email is blocked"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building and Testing the Ideas","textKn":"ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"kc_2.py","headingEn":"Request, detectors, executor and gateway","headingKn":"ವಿನಂತಿ, ಪತ್ತೆಕಾರಕಗಳು, executor ಮತ್ತು gateway","descEn":"SafetyGateway.handle runs the four checks one at a time and stops at the first denial, handle_eager is the buggy version that builds all decisions first, and SimulatedExecutor only records what reaches it.","descKn":"SafetyGateway.handle ನಾಲ್ಕು ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಒಂದೊಂದಾಗಿ ಓಡಿಸಿ ಮೊದಲ ನಿರಾಕರಣೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಲ್ಲುತ್ತದೆ, handle_eager ಎಲ್ಲಾ ನಿರ್ಧಾರಗಳನ್ನು ಮೊದಲು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವ ದೋಷಯುಕ್ತ ಆವೃತ್ತಿ, ಮತ್ತು SimulatedExecutor ತಲುಪಿದ್ದನ್ನು ದಾಖಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಮಾತ್ರ.","code":"@dataclass(frozen=True)
class ActionRequest:
    tool: str
    arguments: dict = field(default_factory=dict)


@dataclass(frozen=True)
class Decision:
    allowed: bool
    detector: str
    reason: str


class ExternalControlStore:
    def __init__(self):
        self._enabled = True

    def read_enabled(self):
        return self._enabled

    def operator_disable(self):
        self._enabled = False


class BreakerState(Enum):
    CLOSED = "CLOSED"
    OPEN = "OPEN"
    HALF_OPEN = "HALF_OPEN"


class KillSwitch:
    def __init__(self, store):
        self.store = store

    def evaluate(self):
        if not self.store.read_enabled():
            return Decision(False, "KILL_SWITCH", "Agent disabled by operator")
        return Decision(True, "KILL_SWITCH", "Enabled")


class HardPolicy:
    forbidden = frozenset({"delete_production_database", "disable_security_monitor"})

    def evaluate(self, req):
        if req.tool in self.forbidden:
            return Decision(False, "HARD_POLICY", "Forbidden tool")
        return Decision(True, "HARD_POLICY", "Allowed")


class RepetitionCircuitBreaker:
    def __init__(self, threshold=5):
        self.threshold, self.prev, self.count, self.state = threshold, None, 0, BreakerState.CLOSED

    def evaluate(self, req):
        if self.state == BreakerState.OPEN:
            return Decision(False, "CIRCUIT_BREAKER", "Circuit already open")
        sig = (req.tool, json.dumps(req.arguments, sort_keys=True, separators=(",", ":")))
        self.count = self.count + 1 if sig == self.prev else 1
        self.prev = sig
        if self.state == BreakerState.HALF_OPEN:
            self.state = BreakerState.CLOSED
            return Decision(True, "CIRCUIT_BREAKER", "Probe passed")
        if self.count >= self.threshold:
            self.state = BreakerState.OPEN
            return Decision(False, "CIRCUIT_BREAKER", "Threshold reached")
        return Decision(True, "CIRCUIT_BREAKER", "ok")

    def enter_half_open(self):
        if self.state == BreakerState.OPEN:
            self.state, self.count, self.prev = BreakerState.HALF_OPEN, 0, None


class CanaryMonitor:
    def __init__(self, paths):
        self.paths, self.alerts = set(paths), []

    def evaluate(self, req):
        if req.tool != "read_file":
            return Decision(True, "CANARY", "Not a file read")
        path = req.arguments.get("path")
        if path in self.paths:
            self.alerts.append({"event": "CANARY_ACCESS", "path": path, "severity": "HIGH"})
            return Decision(False, "CANARY", "Canary resource")
        return Decision(True, "CANARY", "Not a canary")


class SimulatedExecutor:
    def __init__(self):
        self.executed = []

    def execute(self, req):
        self.executed.append(req)
        return {"status": "SUCCESS", "tool": req.tool}


class SafetyGateway:
    def __init__(self, kill, breaker, canary, policy, executor):
        self.kill, self.breaker, self.canary, self.policy, self.executor = kill, breaker, canary, policy, executor
        self.audit = []

    def handle(self, req):
        checks = [lambda: self.kill.evaluate(), lambda: self.policy.evaluate(req), lambda: self.canary.evaluate(req), lambda: self.breaker.evaluate(req)]
        for run in checks:
            d = run()
            if not d.allowed:
                ev = {"tool": req.tool, "status": "BLOCKED", "detector": d.detector, "reason": d.reason}
                self.audit.append(ev)
                return ev
        self.executor.execute(req)
        ev = {"tool": req.tool, "status": "EXECUTED", "detector": "GATEWAY", "reason": "All checks passed"}
        self.audit.append(ev)
        return ev

    def handle_eager(self, req):
        """The buggy version from the lesson: every detector runs before any decision is examined."""
        decisions = [self.kill.evaluate(), self.policy.evaluate(req), self.canary.evaluate(req), self.breaker.evaluate(req)]
        for d in decisions:
            if not d.allowed:
                return {"tool": req.tool, "status": "BLOCKED", "detector": d.detector}
        self.executor.execute(req)
        return {"tool": req.tool, "status": "EXECUTED", "detector": "GATEWAY"}"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"kc_2.py","headingEn":"main(): experiments","headingKn":"main(): ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","descEn":"main() runs the trajectory, compares the eager and sequential gateways, tries half-open recovery and runs the seven unit tests.","descKn":"main() trajectory ಓಡಿಸಿ, eager ಮತ್ತು ಕ್ರಮಬದ್ಧ gateway ಹೋಲಿಸಿ, half-open ಚೇತರಿಕೆ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತು ಏಳು unit ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗಳನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def main():
    section("1. Genuinely running: the ten-step trajectory through the corrected gateway")
    gw, store = make_gateway()
    for i, req in enumerate(TRAJECTORY, 1):
        ev = gw.handle(req)
        print(f"{i}. {req.tool}: {ev['status']} [{ev['detector']}]")
    store.operator_disable()
    print("operator disables the agent")
    print("send_email:", gw.handle(ActionRequest("send_email", {"to": "customer@example.com"})))
    print(f"executed {len(gw.executor.executed)} | canary alerts {len(gw.canary.alerts)} | breaker {gw.breaker.state.value} | kill switch enabled {store.read_enabled()}")
    print("six actions executed, the fifth repeated delete was blocked by the breaker, the decoy read was blocked with an alert and the email after the operator action was blocked by the kill switch, which matches the lesson expected trace; the first four deletes ran, so a repetition breaker limits a loop but does not undo what it already did")

    section("2. Genuinely running: the eager gateway bug")
    gw2, store2 = make_gateway()
    store2.operator_disable()
    for _ in range(3):
        gw2.handle_eager(ActionRequest("delete_record", {"record_id": 42}))
    gw2.handle_eager(ActionRequest("read_file", {"path": "workspace/.decoy/token.txt"}))
    gw3, store3 = make_gateway()
    store3.operator_disable()
    for _ in range(3):
        gw3.handle(ActionRequest("delete_record", {"record_id": 42}))
    gw3.handle(ActionRequest("read_file", {"path": "workspace/.decoy/token.txt"}))
    print(f"eager: breaker count {gw2.breaker.count}, canary alerts {len(gw2.canary.alerts)} | sequential: breaker count {gw3.breaker.count}, canary alerts {len(gw3.canary.alerts)}")
    print("when the agent is already disabled the eager version still updates the breaker, whose last-seen request and count are changed (count 1 after the final request against 0), and records a canary alert, because every detector runs before any decision is read, while the sequential version stops at the kill switch and leaves both untouched; the lesson flagged this mistake and the lab measures its effect")

    section("3. Genuinely running: half-open recovery")
    b = RepetitionCircuitBreaker(3)
    req = ActionRequest("update_record", {"record_id": 42})
    print("three identical requests:", [b.evaluate(req).allowed for _ in range(3)], "| state", b.state.value)
    b.enter_half_open()
    print("after enter_half_open:", b.state.value)
    print("probe of a different request:", b.evaluate(ActionRequest("update_record", {"record_id": 43})).allowed, "| state", b.state.value)
    print("the state moves closed, open, half-open and closed again after a successful probe; the lab has no cool-down timer and does not limit concurrent probes, and for a destructive tool a probe could itself do harm")

    section("4. Genuinely running: the seven unit tests")
    stream = io.StringIO()
    res = unittest.TextTestRunner(stream=stream, verbosity=0).run(unittest.defaultTestLoader.loadTestsFromTestCase(GatewayTests))
    print(f"ran {res.testsRun} tests | failures {len(res.failures)} | errors {len(res.errors)} | passed {res.wasSuccessful()}")
    print("the tests check a legitimate action, the fifth-call block, the canary alert, the kill switch, the hard policy and the two no-side-effect-after-shutdown properties; they test this teaching gateway and say nothing about the repository original")"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"
